   "text": "David Game College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nDavid Game College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nDavid Game College is an independent school and sixth form based in Tower Hill, London. The college is coeducational and admits students between the ages of 13–22. Up to 400 students take full-time courses each year.The college is associated with the CIFE group of independent colleges and promotes an ethos of optimism, hard work and ambition to improve grades and enter a university of the student's choice. 67% of A Level graduates gained entry to Russel Group universities in 2017–2018. David Game College is rated as Outstanding in all areas in its latest Ofsted inspection.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 06:12\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n27/03/2026 06:12\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £26,184.00\nMin: £18,313.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n12%\n300 of 2,500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1989\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n24/09/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3QaTJVzF-AY\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
